description:
We don't use the word "covenant" much any more, but could our ignorance of the concept of covenant cause us to miss out on a deeper relationship with God?  Join us this Sunday as Kevin shares the incredible story of how God bound Himself to his people in covenant relationship.   Drawing from the story of Abraham, in this sermon you will be challenged and inspired to live a more devoted life to God as you discover the fullness of His devotion to you!

